WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.000
Lazy days, warm and free,
pathways to climb, rivers

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
to see, magic's here for you
and me as we travel the roads

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.001
to romance.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.001
A visit to Coral Gables, one of the
world's most beautiful cities, may well

00:00:27.001 --> 00:00:30.001
feature a trip to the new campus
of the University of Miami.

00:00:37.001 --> 00:00:42.001
Today, thronged by students from both Americas,
the campus is an outstanding

00:00:42.001 --> 00:00:44.001
example of modern architecture.

00:00:53.001 --> 00:00:59.000
Fresh water swimming in the world famous
Venetian pools fed by cool artesian

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.000
wells is open to all visitors in the area.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.000
From the mainland, a causeway stretches
across sparkling Biscayne Bay to Cape

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Florida and to Crandon Beach,
certainly one of the most magnificent

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.001
bathing beaches in the world.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.001
This park area, operated as a county
playground, is shaded by thousands of

00:01:40.001 --> 00:01:46.000
graceful palms and was once part of
America's largest coconut plantation.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Fine roads and highways bring many
sightseeing points of interest in the

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.001
surrounding area within easy
reach of the vacationist.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.001
Here is a case of giving the visitor
the bird a gaudy, colorful and noisy

00:02:07.001 --> 00:02:14.001
costume. These macaws are completely
free to fly about with no cages, nets or

00:02:14.001 --> 00:02:16.000
fences to restrain them.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.001
You and your family can enjoy the vacation
thrills of this spot and no matter

00:02:28.001 --> 00:02:34.001
where you live, you can reach it quickly,
comfortably and with utmost economy.

00:02:35.001 --> 00:02:41.000
Travel this year the roads to romance,
to places you have always wanted to go.

00:02:41.001 --> 00:02:46.000
And when you travel, go in one of the
quality motor cars your Chevrolet

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.000
dealer has to offer.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:53.000
It will be your magic carpet
that will carry you to the

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.000
land of your heart's desire.
